 infrastructure needed to include newly backported fragments in patch releases.\n\n**0 open findings**\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>1 resolved since last review</strong></summary>\n\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/high-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/high-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/high-v2-light.png\" alt=\"High severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Ignore changelog.d/README.md during strict fragment validation](#discussion_r4214361605)\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>Previously missed (1)</strong></summary>\n\nIn code that hasn't changed since last review\n\n<details>\n<summary><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> Migrate release branches before relying on Towncrier patch changelogs</summary>\n\n`RELEASING.md:57`\n\n[General] This is not true for already-cut release branches. For example, `release/v2.32.x` currently has neither `towncrier.toml` nor the insertion marker and still runs the old patch workflow, so a newly backported PR's `changelog.d` fragment will be ignored while these instructions no longer ask for a manual `CHANGELOG.md` update. Please migrate every supported release branch to the Towncrier workflow/configuration (or document and retain the legacy step for pre-adoption branches) before relying on automatic patch changelogs.\n</details>\n</details>\n\n\ud83e\udde0 **Review effort:** Balanced\n\n---\n\nGive feedback about Copilot approvals in [this survey](https://survey.alchemer.com/s3/9011660/CCR-Public-Preview-Autoapprove-feedback-survey) to enter a drawing for a $150 gift card.","comment_id":null,"key":"review:5451343381","kind":"body","line":null,"path":null,"review_id":5451343381}],"frozen_at":1791434601,"frozen_at_iso":"2026-10-08T04:43:21Z","frozen_sha":"78e853bbd342cfe6f1b96cabadc51393247d75e9","head_ref":"trask-chloggen-adoption","head_repo":"open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation","head_repo_id":210933087,"launch_run":{"actor_id":218610,"attempt":1,"id":37725710231},"loop_kind":"copilot_review","mode":"publish","pr":20437,"protocol":"reviewable-v1","publication":{"auth_mode":"fine_grained_pat","authorized_actor_id":218610,"authorized_at":1791432270,"continuation_deadline":1791439470,"generation":6,"max_pipelines":5,"phase":"44e135593f024e2792e110864a6d3882","profile":"reviewable-v1","required_checks":["Analyze (actions)","Analyze Java (none)","Analyze Kotlin (manual)","CodeQL","EasyCLA","build / build-servlet-images","build / common / build","build / common / check-gh-aw-lockfiles","build / common / examples","build / common / fossa-configuration-check","build / common / gradle-plugins","build / common / license-check","build / common / repo-checks","build / common / smoke-test (ubuntu-latest, jetty)","build / common / smoke-test (ubuntu-latest, liberty)","build / common / smoke-test (ubuntu-latest, other)","build / common / smoke-test (ubuntu-latest, payara)","build / common / smoke-test (ubuntu-latest, spring-aot)","build / common / smoke-test (ubuntu-latest, tomcat)","build / common / smoke-test (ubuntu-latest, tomee)","build / common / smoke-test (ubuntu-latest, websphere)","build / common / smoke-test (ubuntu-latest, wildfly)","build / common / spotless","build / common / test0 (11, hotspot)","build / common /